{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c8b237a69895e3c7da99671e65a91871db085ad044ee7d1324082a5c38495b39", "ja": "（今日はサジタリアスの握手＆撮影会だ！\n客入りも上々。さて、恵美の様子は……）", "zh": "（今天是『射手座』的握手＆摄影会！\n放眼望去高朋满座。不晓得惠美的状况如何……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "1f12c732ee74de47f93fea590025652ca10213f147bef73c34b02e44374ac2e4", "ja": "{$P$}！\nアタシもう、ダメかも……うぅ……。", "zh": "{$P$}！\n我好像要不行了……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "374a7acc656da9234a41e5ff4602521b8b2024eb83f7829c70deadfd670f8ab4", "ja": "ど、どうしたんだ恵美。\n開始直前なのにそんな弱々しい声をあげて……。", "zh": "怎、怎么啦，惠美？\n表演就要开始了，却还说这么软弱的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "beb930f655451413d75af84bbf27a3019926dbd6ec8cadf68bdf8af9d0c7a0af", "ja": "い、いまお客さんの並びを見てたら……\nあつしくんがいたの！", "zh": "刚、刚才看客人排队的时候……\n我发现小敦也在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1004_p", "source_sha256": "41504dbd76917226372e900fe07548afcf74a950ca039db5c44cc152b79ceda4", "ja": "あつしくん？　……ああ、サジタリアス初公演の時に\n手紙をくれた子どもか。", "zh": "小敦……？啊，你是说『射手座』首次公演时，\n写信给你的那个孩子呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cacd211f628f158d9a814c3f6d5e95317d23fd48e97fb6b02c4fa87a31725f45", "ja": "よかったじゃないか。幼稚園くらいの子が\n熱心なファンになってくれるなんて。", "zh": "这不是很好吗？竟然有差不多才上幼稚园的小孩\n成为你的死忠粉丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "12eefc43e19d123203d3658533105411cc517d833503e90abf1716837b884f3d", "ja": "それはいいんだけど、でもよくないんだってば！\nほら、ここから見える？　あのカッコウ！", "zh": "好是好，但这也不太妙啊！\n你看，从这里是不是看得到？他的打扮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "5ca63ad0503447d8ae0cf70cb067ae8e3709d6f888fd3bfe5372832b2218e93d", "ja": "あつしくん、アタシ達サジタリアスのコスプレしてる\nの！！　しかも友達と一緒に、ちゃんと3人組で！", "zh": "小敦竟然打扮成我们『射手座』的样子！！\n而且还跟朋友一起，凑成了三人组！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f81f605a3c144725c081346e1afb3db1e7f357c2e602eadce2fe212c3e7e7afc", "ja": "……おっ、本当だ！　紙にクレヨンで色を塗って……\nだぶだぶだけど、確かにサジタリアスの衣装だ！", "zh": "……哦，真的耶！用蜡笔在纸上涂色……\n尺寸虽然有点大，但那确实是『射手座』的服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "f71d8b89b4684ecffcd348befd6c589f7f22441d2acbab0c8978b89c64089bf1", "ja": "もー、あんなのかわいすぎ！　反則！\nもう顔がニヤケちゃって、撮影会どころじゃないよ～！", "zh": "讨厌～那也太可爱了！犯规！\n我现在已经笑得合不拢嘴，哪顾得了摄影会呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1010_p", "source_sha256": "278a048db38c975e426924d33e796c0b8923407c391f49c7b68b9fd8a3d87234", "ja": "はは、そうだな。……でも、大丈夫だよ。\nそのニヤけ顔のままでいいから、撮影会に行ってこい！", "zh": "哈哈，的确是……不过，没问题的，\n你就带着这张幸福的笑脸出席摄影会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "5f51894173f5ebecbd5940f96bd603db9b2d7f9280ca70affe3fbe3482d2a00f", "ja": "ええーっ！？", "zh": "咦咦──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "de4b5f0aefeb9c554c4a579d591777c4033eebadbf21725bd144342aa4c684ed", "ja": "アイドルはどんな時でも笑顔でないと。\n心配するな、恵美はニヤけててもかわいいぞ！", "zh": "偶像就该时刻保持微笑。\n不用担心，惠美就算窃笑，一样很可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "77edd27fc1534a6dc90b91ea725106e98f539d346b40efe0d599a549051fddf4", "ja": "え～っ、なにそれ～！　うう～、もう！\nよけいニヤけるっしょ！？　もうっ！", "zh": "咦～！什么啊～！呜呜～讨厌！\n你这样不就害我笑得更开了！？真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "cdbc139e43b393bf06a6225a11ee4bc3efd35b720393a4d95c63594f2d405a07", "ja": "じゃ、行ってくるけど～。\nわ、笑われたら、一生うらむからねっ！？", "zh": "那么，我就过去啰～\n要、要是被嘲笑，我会恨你一辈子的喔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "e0667ec22f7d268e8e21124922750331538acbeda6517ceb00ccb79f95d0e197", "ja": "え、えへへ……や、やっほ～？", "zh": "嘿、嘿嘿……嗨、嗨～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1016_okyaku", "source_sha256": "7353d30ad642679ed66239302a456fe7899ed6a4e85dbac9cad684b617b13335", "ja": "わあああああ！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0103_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1342794c2596f2c4fcced0f8838f0f5ee86536166d611889e2dbe34cf09e8d54", "ja": "（恵美の笑顔が笑われるはずもなく、握手＆撮影会は\n大盛況。幼いファンも、ずっと笑ってくれていたな！）", "zh": "（握手＆摄影会盛况空前，也没人嘲笑惠美的笑脸。\n连年纪小的粉丝也一直笑嘻嘻的呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
